Quick Recap

Topics use hierarchical paths (company/property/category/device)
Wildcards: + matches one level, # matches all remaining levels
QoS levels: 0 (fire and forget), 1 (at least once), 2 (exactly once)
Choose QoS based on message importance and tolerance for loss/duplicates

